 External subroutine subprogram "cyclic_cell_ppm_intp_dp"
  (inc)(line-no.)(nest)(optimize)
            2000                     
            2001                     !-------------------------------------------------------------------------
            2002                     !CWB2021 note, the double precision is called by reducepick/reduceintp
            2003                     !-------------------------------------------------------------------------
            2004                           subroutine cyclic_cell_ppm_intp_dp(pp,qq,pn,qn,lons,nv,lonp,lonn,sc)
            2005                     !
            2006                     ! mass conservation in cyclic bc interpolation: interpolate a group
            2007                     ! of grid point  coordiante call pp at interface with quantity qq at
            2008                     ! cell averaged to a group of new grid point coordinate call pn at
            2009                     ! interface with quantity qn at cell average with ppm spline.
            2010                     ! in horizontal with mass conservation is under the condition that
            2011                     ! variable value at pp(1)= pp(lons+1)=pn(lons+1)
            2012                     !
            2013                     ! pp    location at interfac point as input
            2014                     ! qq    quantity at averaged-cell as input
            2015                     ! pn    location at interface of new grid structure as input
            2016                     ! qn    quantity at averaged-cell as output
            2017                     ! lons  numer of cells for dimension
            2018                     ! lonp  numer of cells for input
            2019                     ! lonn  numer of cells for output
            2020                     ! levs  number of vertical layers
            2021                     ! mono  monotonicity o:no, 1:yes
            2022                     !
            2023                     ! author : henry.juang@noaa.gov
            2024                     !
            2025                     !
            2026                           implicit none
            2027                     !
